<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's IEb cuts prime rate to 23.875pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary's IEb cuts prime rate to 23.875pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Inter-Europa Bank said on Friday it had cut its prime lending rate on forint loans to 23.875 percent from 24.75 percent, effective from January 20.</p>
<p>Inter-Europa Bank is a member of Italy's San Paolo banking group.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom + 36 1 327-4040</p>
